{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0224","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000108:text","row":30287,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"アンテナの場所。","en":"The antenna site.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801091","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00001","en":"The place where the antenna is.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000130:text","row":30288,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"みみ先輩はいない。","en":"Mimi isn't there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801092","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00002","en":"Mimi-senpai isn't here.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000015a:text","row":30289,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"怪我したせいだろうか。","en":"Maybe because she's hurt.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801093","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00003","en":"It's likely because of those injuries.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000188:text","row":30290,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"彼女の部活は、中断されてしまった。","en":"Her club activities have been put on hold.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801094","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00004","en":"Her club activities had been forcibly interrupted.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["addition","tense_aspect"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000001c2:text","row":30291,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"アンテナの根本には、機材やら工具やらが置かれている。","en":"Equipment and tools lie scattered around the base of the antenna.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801095","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00005","en":"At the base of the antenna, machine parts and tools and the like lie scattered about.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","addition"],"assessment":"機材 means equipment or gear, not machine parts; 'lie scattered' also adds disorder to items merely said to be placed there.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":41,"start":28,"text":"machine parts"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000020e:text","row":30292,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"ノートがある。","en":"There's a notebook.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801096","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00006","en":"There's a notebook.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000234:text","row":30293,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"見てみた。","en":"I take a look.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801097","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00007","en":"I try looking at it.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000025e:text","row":30294,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“........................”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801098","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00008","en":"Taichi: \"............\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000028a:text","row":30295,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"なるほど。","en":"I see.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801099","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00009","en":"I see.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000002ac:text","row":30296,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"いろいろ苦労しながらやってたわけだ。","en":"So she's been struggling through one problem after another.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801100","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00010","en":"She was getting things done while going through all kinds of hardships.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000002e8:text","row":30297,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"ＳＯＳねぇ。","en":"An SOS, huh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801101","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00011","en":"An SOS...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000030c:text","row":30298,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"アンテナを立ててＳＯＳ。これでバッチリ。","en":"Put up an antenna. Send an SOS. Perfect.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801102","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00012","en":"An SOS sent via the antenna. That fits right on the mark.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"これでバッチリ means that this makes the plan all set or perfect. The English invents fitting on a mark.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":56,"start":34,"text":"fits right on the mark"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000034c:text","row":30299,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"みみ先輩らしい、素敵な計画である。","en":"A wonderful plan. So very Mimi.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801103","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00013","en":"A wonderful plan this, so like Mimi-senpai.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The Japanese calls it a wonderful plan typical of her. The English uses an unlicensed inversion and a verbless comparison.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":43,"start":0,"text":"A wonderful plan this, so like Mimi-senpai."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000386:text","row":30300,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"みみ先輩一人だと……終わらない作業量に思える。","en":"For Mimi alone... this looks like more work than she could ever finish.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801104","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00014","en":"For Mimi-senpai alone however... it seems likely the amount of work would never end.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000003cc:text","row":30301,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"図面に赤線が引いてある。","en":"Red lines mark the blueprint.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801105","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00015","en":"Red lines have been drawn on parts of the diagrams.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000450:text","row":30302,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"『届かないよ～（泣）』","en":"‘I can't reach up there! (sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801106","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00016","en":"『But I cannot reach this～! (sob)』","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000047e:text","row":30303,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"ははあ。確かに。","en":"Ah. Fair point.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801107","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00017","en":"Hahaha! That's for sure.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice"],"assessment":"ははあ is a sound of realization, like 'aha,' not laughter.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":7,"start":0,"text":"Hahaha!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000004f3:text","row":30304,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"仕方ない。","en":"Guess I'll have to help.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801108","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00018","en":"Well, what can you do.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000515:text","row":30305,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"脚立を立てて、その上にのぼる。","en":"I set up the stepladder and climb it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801109","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00019","en":"I erect the stepladder, and climb above.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that he climbs onto the stepladder. 'Climb above' describes a position higher than it rather than mounting it.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":39,"start":28,"text":"climb above"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000553:text","row":30306,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「ここを……こうかな？」","en":"“This goes... here, maybe?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801110","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Over here... is it like this?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000583:text","row":30307,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"仕上げてやった。","en":"I finish that part for her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801111","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00021","en":"And I was finished.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that Taichi finished the work for her. The English passive instead says that Taichi himself was finished.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":19,"start":4,"text":"I was finished."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000005b3:text","row":30308,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「これでよしと」","en":"“There. Done.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801112","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00022","en":"Taichi: \"This should be right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000005e3:text","row":30309,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「で、次はと……」","en":"“Okay, next...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801113","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Then, next up is...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000060d:text","row":30310,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"図面に視線を落とす。","en":"I look back down at the blueprint.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801114","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00024","en":"I look down at the blueprint.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000068d:text","row":30311,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"『わからないトコ（泣）』","en":"‘Don't get this part. (sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801115","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00025","en":"『Don't understand this part (sob)』","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000006c3:text","row":30312,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"『保留です（泣）』","en":"‘On hold. (sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801116","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00026","en":"『Leaving for later (sob)』","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000006f3:text","row":30313,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"『ここ間違い（泣）』","en":"‘This part is wrong. (sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801117","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00027","en":"『This is wrong (sob)』","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000725:text","row":30314,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"『？？？（泣）』","en":"‘??? (sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801118","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00028","en":"『??? (sob)』","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000753:text","row":30315,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"『間違えたカモ……あとで確認（泣）』","en":"‘Might've gotten this wrong... Check later. (sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801119","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00029","en":"『Made a mistake maybe... verify later (sob)』","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000795:text","row":30316,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"『ワイヤー切れた、代用できるものを探さないと……（泣）』","en":"‘Wire broke. Need to find something else that'll work... (sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801120","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00030","en":"『A wire snapped, and I cannot look for something that could work as replacement (sob)』","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"探さないと means that she must look for a substitute. The English reverses this into an inability to look.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":48,"start":21,"text":"I cannot look for something"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000007eb:text","row":30317,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"『（泣）』","en":"‘(sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801121","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00031","en":"『(sob)』","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000813:text","row":30318,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"『（泣）』","en":"‘(sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801122","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00032","en":"『(sob)』","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000083b:text","row":30319,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"『（泣）』","en":"‘(sob)’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801123","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00033","en":"『(sob)』","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000008aa:text","row":30320,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"泣き言だらけじゃねぇか。","en":"This whole notebook is one long sob story.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801124","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00034","en":"Ain't this full of whining now.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:000008e7:text","row":30321,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「……みみ先輩……」","en":"“...Mimi...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801125","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00035","en":"Taichi: \"...Mimi-senpai...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000913:text","row":30322,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"アンテナを見てみる。","en":"I look up at the antenna.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801126","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00036","en":"I try looking at the antenna.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:0000093f:text","row":30323,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"放送局……か。","en":"A radio station... huh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801127","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00037","en":"A Broadcast Station... then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000a48:text","row":30324,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"ＳＯＳの効果はともかく。","en":"Whether or not the SOS does any good.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801128","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00038","en":"Whatever the result of the SOS,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000a78:text","row":30325,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"みんなで放送をするということが、妙に心を弾ませた。","en":"Something about the idea of all of us broadcasting together makes my heart leap.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801129","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00039","en":"the idea of broadcasting with everyone together was a strange encouragement for my heart.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that the idea strangely excited or exhilarated him. The English turns the emotional response into an external encouragement directed at his heart.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":88,"start":52,"text":"a strange encouragement for my heart"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000ac2:text","row":30326,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"あまりにも健全すぎるから。","en":"Maybe because it is all so painfully wholesome.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801130","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00040","en":"Because it is excessively wholesome.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000af4:text","row":30327,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"健全さからは対角に位置する俺たちの、琴線に触れるのだ。","en":"For people like us, as far from wholesome as you can get, it strikes a chord.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801131","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00041","en":"Wholesomeness harps on the heartstrings of us who exist on the opposite side from it.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","mistranslation"],"assessment":"琴線に触れる means 'strikes a chord.' 'Harps on' means to repeat something tiresomely and therefore reverses the intended attraction.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":39,"start":0,"text":"Wholesomeness harps on the heartstrings"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000b42:text","row":30328,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"こうして。","en":"And so—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801132","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00042","en":"And with this,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0224:00000b64:text","row":30329,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"俺は『部活』をはじめた。","en":"I begin my ‘club activities.’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801133","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0044:00043","en":"I began Club Activities.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
